---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Getting Started with Sustainability | Jason Garvin";
const description = "Sustainability can be a complicated and difficult topic to jump into, so I've compiled resources to help you get started.";
const canonicalUrl = "https://jasongarvin.com/projects/sustainability";
---

<BaseLayout
  description={description}
  title={title}
  canonicalUrl={canonicalUrl}>

  <main id="main-content">

    <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
      <ul class="list-hor">
        <li>
          <a href="/">Home</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <i class="fa fa-chevron-right"></i>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/projects/">Projects</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <i class="fa fa-chevron-right"></i>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>Sustainability</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero-content vertical-space centered transparent-bg">
      <h1 class="cta-header">Sustainability</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Helping to build a more renewable future
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="vertical-space">
      <h2>What is Sustainability?</h2>
      <p>
        Sustainability is a multi-faceted topic. In short, it's a deliberate
        focus on resource management to create renewable cycles that promote
        environmentally-friendly policies ranging from manufacturing to energy
        usage to how you dispose of trash.
      </p>
      <p>
        There's a great deal of depth to it&mdash;you could spend
        a lifetime becoming an expert in a single field: energy, waste
        management, recycling, and more. But, to get involved, all you need is
        a basic understanding of the topic and an urge to make a difference.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've compiled a list of beginner-friendly resources to help get you up
        to speed.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="vertical-space box-emphasis">
      <h2>Resources</h2>
      <p>
        Here are some sustainability-related resources I've found throughout my
        research.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://greengamesguide.com/" rel="external" target="_blank">The Green Game's Guide</a>
          <span>
            - a guide to sustainable manufacturing and publishing within the
            game industry.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://go.ipoint-systems.com/blog/the-green-deal-and-the-circular-economy" rel="external" target="_blank">Circular Economy Action Plan: How the EU Green Deal Is Transforming Europe’s Economy</a>
          <span>
            - a deep dive into the Circular Economy Action Plan
            implemented in the EU and how it promotes sustainability.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://commission.europa.eu/topics/competitiveness/clean-industrial-deal_en" rel="external" target="_blank">Clean Industrial Deal</a>
          <span>
            - a writeup by the European Commission detailing policies designed
            to make energy more affordable and increase its adoption rate.
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="buffer card-flex">
      <section class="width-50">
        <h2>Basics of Sustainability</h2>

        <p>
          Want to take your sustainability learning to the next level? Check out
          these lessons.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog/posts/sustainability-101">Sustainability 101</a>
            <span>
              - learn the basics and how to implement renewable lessons in your
              life.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://fsc.org/en/blog/why-is-sustainability-important" rel="external" target="_blank">Why is Sustainability Important</a>
            <span>
              - explore the topic in broad strokes and how it relates to
              business and individual action.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://learningforsustainability.net/" rel="external" target="_blank">Learning for Sustainability</a>
            <span>
              - an incredible hub of lessons and information.
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="width-50">
        <h2>Intro to Recycling</h2>

        <p>
          The most approachable step towards making your life more sustainable.
        </p>
        <p>
          Learn how to recycle better at home and in your community.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.wm.com/us/en/recycle-right/recycling-101" rel="external" target="_blank">Recycling 101</a>
            <span>
              - learn what can be recycled and how to avoid common misconceptions.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.epa.gov/recycle/recycling-basics-and-benefits" rel="external" target="_blank">Recycling Basics and Benefits</a>
            <span>
              - explore US policy on recycling and how to get involved.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://naturespath.com/blogs/posts/19-activities-kids-learn-recycling" rel="external" target="_blank">19 Activities for Kids to Learn About Recycling</a>
            <span>
              - get your kids excited about recycling!
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
